{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "ddaf5e4601ca355f8d5f3d9da2f15c24639bdd0aaaec9bae28ee9ed486769942", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さーん！\n駄菓子、いかがですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生——！\n要不要来点粗点心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9d77263ee1ff5662453c7462dae3003ef64ab80383ee54515c15bf9001d24a6d", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん！\nこれ、いただいていいんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐！这个我可以收下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1034", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "f3e57c6d123afd5b215c5fc431df785f89789a50a4b9ef2e41855652f04f996b", "ja": "はい、どうぞ！　お仕事中の糖分補給に\nピッタリですよ。それにこれ、当たりつきなんです！", "zh": "好的，请！工作时补充糖分正合适。而且这个还有中奖机会呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "99fde2334ac961dc8d018d245a7650d6047b4f300643b4c4a483393c2a1e776f", "ja": "へえ～、なんだかそういうのワクワク\nしますね。童心に帰ると言うか……。", "zh": "诶～，这种东西总让人觉得有点兴奋呢。\n或者说……有种重返童年的感觉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "923164b71c502ad68611b50caedee332afef5e526b00f5412d52862c944efd41", "ja": "そうですよね～。これ、音無先輩にもらったん\nですけど……あっ、そうだ！", "zh": "是呀～总觉得这种事让人很兴奋呢。算是找回童心吧……嗯，这是音无前辈送给我的……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "ef7fa6838aec5b2178b0d35fdd68ba0fbf959aa7a6b19305afdf979eebf70b22", "ja": "社長さんが、{$P$}さんのこと\nお呼びでした！　何かお話があるとか。", "zh": "社长说，有事要找{$P$}先生！\n好像是有什么话要说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "14e717b52abff47c4ea3f8c34cc112892bf3d25227c1c0fcbdf75016e62b0da6", "ja": "お、そうでしたか。それじゃ早速、行ってみますね。\n駄菓子、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。那我这就过去看看。\n粗点心，谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "1a4bcde1a1ee8b9c379385dc3b80d6a348505ca6986971dbd74ad62456fe6e7c", "ja": "はい。行ってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好的。路上小心哦——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5ad5add17e94f109c66e8a83ea81c4fbd0d4aeb1106da2e60c7e7907adeef2a6", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れ様です！", "zh": "社长、音无小姐，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "6aac359732927ee1e580f0423095e0bb823fda7ac44bc4cadb56f9ca2b0b1bca", "ja": "ムグッ……！　おお君、早速来てくれたのか。\n早かったのでびっくりしたよ。……ゲホ、ゲホ！", "zh": "呜……！哦，你这么快就来了啊。\n没想到你来得这么早，吓了我一跳。……咳、咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "08cc891dd9523320448a60bb68ed3632369b3f6c228aac7a69339d6ddbfd900b", "ja": "社長、大丈夫ですか？\nはい、お茶をどうぞ！", "zh": "社长，您没事吧？\n来，请喝茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "23b8fa8a21191dbc1992a40d96931921f6a6ef3ac7d6064f0e41b0e9ceb6a8d4", "ja": "ゴホッ……、ありがとう音無君。\nグビグビ……。", "zh": "咳……谢谢你，音无君。\n咕嘟咕嘟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8ebfe165e17ef10850bf3621435b7c0a41330d96a7ec0e655848f151e1888020", "ja": "だ、大丈夫ですか、社長？　\nすみません、驚かせてしまって……。", "zh": "您、您没事吧，社长？  \n对不起，吓到您了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "5886e943dd1d720e81da36205eccf929fffd3c17782820798fb17b892c74c65f", "ja": "なに、大したことはない。ちょっと、きな粉棒の\nきな粉が喉に詰まっただけだよ。ハッハッハッ。", "zh": "没什么大不了的。只是吃黄豆粉棒时，黄豆粉卡在喉咙里了而已。哈哈哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "33c00f55429ae42dea00d5e6eb7db453b6b1fc1ef1fb181a58240b90533a08bd", "ja": "そうですか、よかった……。ところで社長、\n今日は何かお話があると聞いたのですが。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好……对了，社长，听说您今天有事要说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "c315980326eb06af948958c497efe9837bec62d065607ddc32165fba3af41880", "ja": "そうそう！　実は、あるユニットの\n再公演を行いたいと思っていてね。", "zh": "对了对了！其实，我想给某个组合\n再举办一次公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4c3244cb191ff392a9c31c5d8469bd53790abe79eaed9087b59668243bd29427", "ja": "あるユニット、と言いますと？", "zh": "你说的某个组合，是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "ea955fd8f1f166c76ea47cae7f974b3939dbb554c09b21cf138f7a4d445f39b5", "ja": "レトロでポップなユニット……。\nそう、Jelly PoP Beansのことだよ！", "zh": "复古又流行的组合……\n没错，就是Jelly PoP Beans！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "500d66aae9c39483a5d0d9d512dcf52c52b41b887a3a13dcb28b27479358f262", "ja": "Jelly PoP Beansと言うと、\nロコ、歩、昴、桃子のユニットですね！", "zh": "说到Jelly PoP Beans，\n就是ROCO、步、昴、桃子的组合对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "45082966bb6406e70d89a4151f4b414d12536a046e13ba701248afdf17a22be4", "ja": "その通り。彼女たちの再登場を期待する声が、\nとても多くてね。リバイバル公演といこうではないか！", "zh": "正是如此。期待她们再次登场的呼声非常高。就来举办复出演出吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e00ef76ccc045e57bc6d526871cc264501cb54a60d3b0fa91df4fdd291e02961", "ja": "それはいいですね！　でもそれなら、他にも何か\nしたいですね。公演に向けて弾みがつくような……。", "zh": "这个主意不错！不过既然这样，我还想做点别的。做些能为公演预热的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e23856d7fcbd6205582a9bcf1cb0fe4a5a527ef345a8078a541493e6dc35fdab", "ja": "そうだ、ネット配信をするのはどうでしょう？　公演の\n宣伝も兼ねて、改めて彼女たちを知ってもらうんです。", "zh": "对了，要不要进行网络直播？也能顺便宣传公演，让大家重新认识她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "7926f8f9140c67fc8a0eeadcc2e26a98a8577d430cfe2e212c7f77de6c308f83", "ja": "インターネットの番組か……なるほど。\nいいではないか！　で、どんな内容にするのかね？", "zh": "网络节目吗……原来如此。\n不错嘛！那么，准备做什么内容呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "53c364e738548d5a28851f03e285ed9106ac1b67f28af29d31c185a8c67c93a2", "ja": "うーん、そうですね……。彼女たちの魅力を\nアピールするのに一番いい方法は……。", "zh": "嗯……是啊……要想展现她们的魅力，最好的办法是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "d34a6d5ede28344c1c926eba0df32e3f351e9139152f31e24b12683890428e78", "ja": "Jelly PoP Beansと言えば、レトロポップで\nどこか懐かしい感じですよね……。", "zh": "说到Jelly PoP Beans，就是复古流行\n又带点怀旧的感觉对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "d31d57f745d93f0d3a130b29c16ea5c9529089977e5ce01697897c6ec50fdc9d", "ja": "うむ。実は私の古い業界仲間にも、彼女たちのファンは\n多いのだが……まさに懐かしい感じがいいそうだよ。", "zh": "嗯。其实我以前的业内老朋友中，也有不少是她们的粉丝……听说正是那种怀旧的感觉很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "5ae7712b9ae6f46e36642fb3a43e9596f7cd2ea041a6e7e1dc8de7977cc33bc6", "ja": "懐かしい感じか……では、少しレトロな遊園地から\n配信を行う、と言うのはどうでしょう？", "zh": "怀旧的感觉吗……那么，去稍微复古一点的游乐园进行直播，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "dcac0c935adcf20684bb61fc244a0f14cd5e86bf5d06577201e42b2f5a7a7be4", "ja": "ちょっと、心当たりのある場所がありまして。\nユニットの世界観にも合っていると思います。", "zh": "我正好想到一个地方。\n我觉得也很符合组合的世界观。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "164cebca43f9c4c1635a3402f8f5cdc60f54ab5fddc68b005116a0aabb4eedf2", "ja": "わあ♪　遊園地からって、すごく楽しそうですね。\nさすが、{$P$}さんです♪", "zh": "哇♪　从游乐园开始，听上去非常有趣呢。\n不愧是{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "13baaac26a48da494d43ffadee08ba2b2a42c43e08a29368420d8b3821d3c085", "ja": "うむ、私も、なかなかの名アイディアだと\n思うよ！　では、その方向で進めてくれたまえ！", "zh": "嗯，我也觉得这是个相当不错的好点子！\n那么，就按这个方向去推进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "34e600bf81214d0043bc9df0638955f8d00acf31be8b57f2e805965a2edcbb90", "ja": "はい！　じゃあ、早速みんなに伝えて、\n手はずを整えます！", "zh": "好的！那我马上去告诉大家，安排好相关事宜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "8e9bbda3e4dbf39dc99908a94ba641737347de7c8c8579c014ffbb3067d4e3aa", "ja": "うむ、よろしく頼んだよ！", "zh": "嗯，那就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "33e11e9a7aa69a77afa4f051780fcd1495032866d70d24c7be8d7e2d2f4b782d", "ja": "（みんなのリバイバル公演が盛り上がるように、\n楽しい企画を用意しないとな！）", "zh": "（得准备些有趣的企划，让大家的复出演出热闹起来才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
